# Keep GitHub's Linguist language stats focused on the real infrastructure
# work (Ansible/Python/Shell/config), not the large LaTeX + Markdown
# documentation set that would otherwise report this repo as "TeX".
*.tex   linguist-documentation
*.sty   linguist-documentation
*.cls   linguist-documentation
*.bib   linguist-documentation
docs/**            linguist-documentation
audit/**           linguist-documentation
runbooks/**        linguist-documentation
student-guide/**   linguist-documentation
vault/**           linguist-documentation
topology/**        linguist-documentation
